      "comment": "TERRIFIC NERO (1) is a consistent dog overall, in the frame at five of 14 starts including six wins but missed the frame latest when fifth (31.10) over 530m at this track. Has a strong winning record at this journey. Drawn the fence and expected to go close. QUICK STRIKE (7) has been in the money at her last two runs, most recently when third (31.22) in a Grade 6 over 530m at this track. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Can improve sharply here. LOVE SHINE (2) has been a little hard to follow, missing the frame last time but was a Best 8 winner three starts ago and has drawn 2 where he has two wins. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Rates a winning chance on best. SPEED RAIDER (4) has top-three aspirations after placing last time.",
